                <pb facs="0859" n="739" sameAs="frus:frus1922v01/pg739"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113/318: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Child</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-15T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                                1922—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>122. Your 121, July 24, 1 p.m.</p>
                <p>Cannot Italian Government now give definite reply to proposal contained in
                    Department’s 98 of July 14, 4 p.m.?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
